# Imitation datasets are large and reproducible from a seed + a pinned env; the
# manifest hash recorded in docs/status.md is what makes a run auditable, not the
# npzs themselves. Metrics (expert_benchmark.json, run.json, logs) ARE committed.
outputs/imitation/datasets/
outputs/imitation/scratch/
outputs/imitation/runs/**/*.pt
# M5c.4 export: compiled model + physics inputs, regenerated by imitation/gpu_sim/export_episode.py
outputs/imitation/gpu_sim/**/*.mjb
outputs/imitation/gpu_sim/**/*.npz
outputs/imitation/**/events.out.tfevents.*
outputs/cloth_angles/
.DS_Store
**/MUJOCO_LOG.TXT
.venv-warp/
.venv-isaac/
/Assets
# Run outputs and videos stay on WATcloud / the local disk (2026-10-22 cleanup; tag pre-cleanup-2026-10-22 has the
# old ones). Showcase videos live in docs/reports/media.
outputs/isaac/
outputs/videos/
outputs/cloth_fold_rl/
outputs/imitation/smoke/
renders/
*.mp4
!docs/reports/media/*.mp4
.claude/
